  "body_html": "<p>Embrace faith and comfort with our custom Bible Verse Christian Blanket, designed to bring warmth, peace, and daily encouragement. This personalized blanket is a heartfelt keepsake, perfect for believers who cherish inspiration and faith-filled homes.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Add a name or date to create a one-of-a-kind blanket, making it a unique and meaningful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational present for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms, ideal for moms, grandmas, and daughters.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Skin-Friendly Fabric:</strong> Crafted from a soft, skin-friendly blend, ensuring cozy comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Uplifting Verses:</strong> Features uplifting Bible verses, surrounding you in scripture and encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, with quick air drying for lasting fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for prayer time, quiet reflection, or simply cozying up at home.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
